[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/core/document.gd" id="1_doc"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_doc")
id = &"d19_reel_index"
title = "Tape library — index"
byline = "typed, with pencil corrections, undated"
hand = 0
body = "OBSERVER CHANNEL RECORDINGS
INDEXED BY RUN. FILED BY ACCESSION.

RUN 1   09/64 to 10/64
        RF-0071 to 0098

RUN 2   02/65 to 03/65
        RF-0114 to 0149

RUN 3   11/65 to 12/65
        RF-0202 to 0244

RUN 4   06/67 to 08/67
        RF-0310 to 0388

RUN 5   03/69 to 04/69
        RF-0401 to 0432

RUN 6   09/71 to 11/71
        RF-0500 to 0561

RUN 7   05/73 to 06/73
        RF-0604 to 0637

RUN 8   01/75 to 02/75
        RF-0700 to 0741

RUN 9   05/77 to ??/77
        RF-0801 to 0840

ONE REEL PER DAY OF RUN. DAY ONE IS THE
FIRST ACCESSION OF ITS BLOCK.

EACH BLOCK IS BOXED IN THREE. BOX A IS THE
FIRST THIRD OF THE BLOCK, B THE SECOND, C
THE LAST. A REEL IS CALLED BY ITS RUN AND
ITS BOX: RUN 9 BOX C IS \"9-C\".

THE SHELVES ARE IN ACCESSION ORDER. THEY
ARE NOT IN RUN ORDER. DO NOT REFILE.

RUN 9 CLOSING DATE NOT SUPPLIED.
BLOCK ALLOCATED TO 0840 AGAINST A 28 DAY
SCHEDULE PLUS CONTINGENCY."
